description: |
    The precedence of various sources of environment variables has
    been documented. See :ref:`environment-variables` for the details.

    .. important::

        Breaking change: the order of :tmt:story:`test </spec/tests/environment>`
        and :ref:`guest </plugins/provision/common-keys>` environment
        has been changed: the test is now the lower priority one, and
        guest environment overrides it.
